config BR2_PACKAGE_BIGFOSTON_GPS
	bool "bigfoston-gps"
	help
	  GPS of the FOSTON FS-707DC: bfgps runs the device's own Windows CE
	  gps.dll (MediaTek MT3328 MNL) in a Linux process and publishes NMEA
	  and a status file (docs/gps.md). The DLL image is extracted from the
	  device's NAND by tools/bigfoston/gps-extract.py and kept on its SD
	  card; it is not part of BigFoston.
